Private Increase KPI Timeout
    [Arguments]                              ${kpi_timeout}
    ...                                      ${kpi_multiplier}=2
    Robot Log Operation                      Increasing timeout by ${kpi_multiplier} times due to SISOCRT-2433
    ${kpi_timeout}=                          Evaluate
    ...                                      ${kpi_timeout} * ${kpi_multiplier}
    [Return]                                 ${kpi_timeout}
